---
title: Playlists
description: Playlist creation and track association management endpoints.
section: Playlists
order: 9
method: GET
endpoint: /playlists/:id
---

## Get Playlist

```http
GET /playlists/:id
```

### Headers

- `x-api-key`: `<your_client_api_key>` (or `Authorization: Bearer <key>`)

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
{
  "id": "pl_12345",
  "name": "Indie Pop Selection",
  "description": "Koleksi lagu indie pop pilihan.",
  "tracks": [
    {
      "id": "trk_7f9a2b1c",
      "title": "Jatuh Suka",
      "artist_name": "Tulus",
      "duration": 224
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## Create Playlist (Master Only)

```http
POST /playlists
```

### Headers

- `X-Master-Key`: `<your_master_secret>`

### Request Body

```json
{
  "name": "Senja & Kopi",
  "description": "Lagu santai untuk menemani sore."
}
```

### Response (`201 Created`)

```json
{
  "id": "pl_67890",
  "name": "Senja & Kopi"
}
```
